@startuml sequence

title Submit Flag - Sequence Diagram

actor Participant
participant "Web Page" as Web
participant "Flask App" as App
database "Database" as DB

Participant -> Web : Enter flag
Web -> App : Submit flag and challenge ID

App -> DB : Check registration and competition
DB --> App : Return information

alt Registered and competition is active
    App -> DB : Get correct flag
    DB --> App : Return flag

    App -> App : Compare answers

    alt Correct answer
        App -> DB : Save submission and points
        DB --> App : Confirm submission
        App --> Web : Display correct answer and score
    else Incorrect answer
        App --> Web : Display incorrect answer
    end

else Not eligible
    App --> Web : Display error message
end

Web --> Participant : Show result

@enduml
